<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's net foreign reserves rise to $9.83 bln.</title>
<headline>Colombia's net foreign reserves rise to $9.83 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's net foreign reserves rose $24.8 million to $9.827 billion from February 14-21, the latest period for which official figures are available, the central bank said.</p>
<p>    It said gross foreign reserves totalled $10.315 billion as of February 21, $375.4 million more than they totalled on</p>
<p>December 30 of last year.</p>
<p>    ((-- Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
